        "html": "<body>\n\n\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Case Edenred — Hyper Island</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,700;1,800&amp;family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n/* ===== CSS VARIABLES — LIGHT THEME ===== */\n:root {\n  --hi-black: #F5F4F0;\n  --hi-white: #111110;\n  --hi-orange: #FF7300;\n  --hi-orange-light: #FF8C00;\n  --hi-gray: #ECEAE4;\n  --hi-gray-mid: #D4D1C8;\n  --hi-gray-light: #888580;\n  --hi-gray-pale: #444240;\n  --hi-accent: #2A2927;\n\n  --font-heading: 'ABC Gravity', 'Barlow Condensed', 'Oswald', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n  --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n  --spacing-md: 2rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 8rem;\n}\n\n/* ===== RESET ===== */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n/* ===== BASE ===== */\nbody {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'ABC Gravity';\n  src: local('ABC Gravity');\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4, .label {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n}\n\n/* ===== HERO ===== */\n.case-hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0.45;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    transparent 0%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 40%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 75%,\n    #0A0A0A 100%\n  );\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.case-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.case-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo img {\n  height: 40px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.92;\n  filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\n}\n\n.closing-client-logo {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-client-logo img {\n  height: 36px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 6rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\n.hero-title em {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n\n.hero-meta-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.meta-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n.meta-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n/* ===== SCROLL INDICATOR ===== */\n.scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator span {\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.scroll-line {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hi-orange), transparent);\n  animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }\n}\n\n/* ===== INTRO SECTION ===== */\n.intro-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.intro-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.intro-body p:first-child {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--hi-accent);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.intro-body p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* ===== STATS BAND ===== */\n.stats-band {\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.stats-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.stat-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #0A0A0A;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.stat-desc {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.65);\n}\n\n/* ===== TIMELINE SECTIONS ===== */\n.timeline-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.timeline-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n  padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.timeline-year {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.timeline-year.active {\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--hi-orange);\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n.timeline-header-content {\n  padding-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-tag {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== CONTENT GRID ===== */\n.content-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-grid.two-col {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n}\n\n.content-grid.text-image {\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-grid.image-text {\n  grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-text p {\n  font-size: 0.975rem;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n.content-text strong {\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.content-text h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n/* ===== QUOTE BLOCK ===== */\n.quote-block {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.quote-block::before {\n  content: '\"';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -1rem;\n  right: var(--spacing-md);\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.1;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.quote-text {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-style: italic;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* ===== MEDIA COMPONENTS ===== */\n.media-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-image.portrait { aspect-ratio: 3/4; }\n.media-image.wide { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n\n.media-video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-caption {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  padding: 0.5rem 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== PHOTO GALLERY ===== */\n.photo-gallery {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 .gallery-item {\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-4 {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-4 .gallery-item {\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n/* 2-col asymmetric: large left + two stacked right */\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left {\n  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left .gi-tall {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  grid-row: 1 / 3;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left .gi-small {\n  grid-column: 2;\n}\n\n/* 2-col asymmetric: two stacked left + large right */\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right .gi-small {\n  grid-column: 1;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right .gi-tall {\n  grid-column: 2;\n  grid-row: 1 / 3;\n}\n\n.gallery-item {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.gallery-item img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n}\n\n.gallery-item:hover img {\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n}\n\n/* ===== APPROACH PILLS ===== */\n.approach-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.approach-item {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.approach-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 3rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content h4 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n/* ===== META SKILLS GRID ===== */\n.meta-skills-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n  gap: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.meta-skill-item {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.meta-skill-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.meta-skill-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n/* ===== HIGHLIGHT BOX ===== */\n.highlight-box {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.highlight-box::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.highlight-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.highlight-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== DIVIDER ===== */\n.section-divider {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.section-divider hr {\n  border: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== VIDEO FEATURE ===== */\n.video-feature {\n  position: relative;\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.video-feature-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.video-feature-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 1.5rem;\n  height: 2px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.video-feature video {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n/* ===== TESTIMONIAL BAND ===== */\n.testimonial-band {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.testimonial-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.testimonial-quote {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.testimonial-quote p {\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.75;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  max-width: 860px;\n}\n\n.testimonial-quote cite {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-style: normal;\n}\n\n/* ===== DARK BAND ===== */\n.dark-band {\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.dark-band-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.dark-band-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.dark-band-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n.dark-band-text {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: rgba(245,244,240,0.6);\n}\n\n/* ===== VIDEO SECTION ===== */\n.video-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.video-section-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.video-section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  max-width: 500px;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.video-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.video-item video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.video-label {\n  padding: 0.6rem 0 0.2rem;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  border-top: 2px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n/* ===== CLOSING SECTION ===== */\n.closing-section {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.closing-section::before {\n  content: 'HYPER\\AISLAND';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -2rem;\n  right: -1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 10rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  white-space: pre;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.closing-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.closing-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.closing-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-text {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n.cta-block {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.cta-block-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.cta-block p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.75);\n}\n\n.cta-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n}\n\n.cta-button:hover { background: #333; }\n\n/* ===== FULL-WIDTH IMAGE BREAK ===== */\n.fullwidth-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-height: 600px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== TAGS / SKILL BADGES ===== */\n.skill-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;\n}\n\n.skill-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.skill-badge.orange {\n  border-color: var(--hi-orange);\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  background: rgba(255,115,0,0.06);\n}\n\n/* ===== EDITION TIMELINE ===== */\n.edition-timeline {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n  gap: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.edition-item {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.edition-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.edition-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.edition-text {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n/* ===== ANIMATION ON SCROLL ===== */\n.fade-up {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(30px);\n  transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\n}\n\n.fade-up.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  :root {\n    --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n    --spacing-xl: 4rem;\n  }\n\n  .intro-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .intro-sidebar { position: static; }\n  .intro-number { font-size: 5rem; }\n\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .content-grid.two-col,\n  .content-grid.text-image,\n  .content-grid.image-text { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; height: 320px; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .video-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .closing-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .dark-band-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .timeline-header { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .timeline-year { font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem); }\n\n  .hero-meta { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n\n  .meta-skills-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .edition-timeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: auto; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left .gi-tall,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right .gi-tall { grid-column: 1; grid-row: auto; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-left .gi-small,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-asym-right .gi-small { grid-column: 1; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hero-meta { gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .meta-skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .edition-timeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"case-hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia01_Reduzida__301.jpg?v=1779373647\" alt=\"Edenred × Hyper Island\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"case-label\">Case de Transformação</div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-client-logo\">\n      <img src=\"https://companieslogo.com/img/orig/EDEN.PA_BIG.D-1e4cab0f.png?t=1720244491\" alt=\"Edenred\">\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Cinco anos<br>construindo <em>cultura</em><br><em>e liderança</em> juntos</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Cliente</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Edenred Brasil</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Período</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">2022 – Presente</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Projetos</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Acelera + Dream Team Bootcamp</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Desenvolvimento &amp; Transformação Cultural</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">\n    <div class=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n    <span>Scroll</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"intro-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"intro-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"intro-number\">ED</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-label\">Sobre a parceria</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-title\">5 anos.<br>2 programas.<br>695+ pessoas.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-body\">\n    <p>Quando uma empresa cresce rápido, parte do desafio é visível nos números. A outra parte vive nas pessoas, nas histórias que cada time carrega, nos jeitos distintos de trabalhar que se acumulam a cada nova aquisição.</p>\n    <p>A Edenred no Brasil é uma empresa que conhece bem esse desafio. Presente em segmentos que vão do Ticket Refeição aos meios de pagamento, da mobilidade aos benefícios para colaboradores, a empresa chegou ao seu porte atual por uma combinação de crescimento orgânico e aquisições. O resultado é uma organização vigorosa, diversa, e atravessada por subculturas que precisam encontrar uma linguagem comum.</p>\n    <p>Foi nesse contexto que a Edenred passou a contar com a Hyper Island. Cinco anos depois, a parceria se desdobrou em dois programas complementares: o desenvolvimento dos talentos que vão liderar o futuro da empresa, e o fortalecimento da cultura entre os líderes que conduzem o presente.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Liderança Emergente</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Transformação Cultural</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Meta Skills</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Team Building</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Cultura Organizacional</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Diversidade &amp; Inclusão</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Inovação</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Desenvolvimento de Pessoas</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== STATS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">695+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Pessoas Impactadas</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">5</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Anos de Parceria</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">5</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Edições do Acelera</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">400+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Líderes no Dream Team</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== FULL WIDTH IMAGE ==================== -->\n<img class=\"fullwidth-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/DJI_0436.jpg?v=1779373652\" alt=\"Edenred Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<!-- ==================== PROGRAMA ACELERA ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year active\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Programa Acelera · 2022 – Presente</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Preparando as próximas<br>lideranças da Edenred</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>Em 2022, a Edenred trouxe um desafio preciso: como preparar as pessoas identificadas como próximas lideranças da empresa para dar o salto de talento individual para líder de verdade? A resposta foi o <strong>Programa Acelera</strong>, uma jornada de desenvolvimento que chegou à quinta edição em 2025 e já impactou 175 participantes.</p>\n      <p>O Acelera foi desenhado para profissionais de todas as unidades de negócio — das áreas de jurídico, financeiro e RH — que a empresa enxerga como candidatos às primeiras posições de liderança. Turmas de cerca de 35 pessoas que precisam desenvolver ao mesmo tempo uma consciência sobre si mesmas, uma capacidade de liderar equipes e uma visão mais ampla do ecossistema em que atuam.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">EU</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Eu / Você</h4>\n            <p>O ponto de partida é sempre o indivíduo: autoconhecimento, valores e a consciência do próprio estilo de liderança.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">NÓS</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Nós / Equipe</h4>\n            <p>A dinâmica coletiva, o trabalho em grupos multifuncionais e a construção de confiança entre pessoas de áreas distintas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">ECO</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Clientes / Ecossistema</h4>\n            <p>A dimensão mais ampla do relacionamento com clientes, parceiros e o ambiente de negócio como um todo.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_38_00.png?v=1779373703\" alt=\"Programa Acelera Edenred\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n      <div class=\"quote-block\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n        <p class=\"quote-text\">O que diferencia um líder capaz é sua habilidade de aprender continuamente, de construir relações rápidas e genuínas, de se adaptar sem perder o eixo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- META SKILLS -->\n  <div style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hi-orange); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\">As 5 Meta Skills do Programa</div>\n    <div class=\"meta-skills-grid\">\n      <div class=\"meta-skill-item\">\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-number\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-title\">Criatividade &amp; Inovação</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-skill-item\">\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-number\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-title\">Rapport &amp; Relacionamento Rápido</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-skill-item\">\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-number\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-title\">Agilidade &amp; Adaptabilidade</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-skill-item\">\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-number\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-title\">Prospecção &amp; Foresight</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-skill-item\">\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-number\">05</div>\n        <div class=\"meta-skill-title\">Prosperando através de Propósito</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Galeria Acelera -->\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery gallery-asym-left\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-tall\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_11_01_22.png?v=1779373703\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_44_00.png?v=1779373704\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_51_19.png?v=1779373704\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-4\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_11_04_17.png?v=1779373703\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_11_10_39.png?v=1779373704\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_39_57.png?v=1779373704\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_48_26.png?v=1779373704\" alt=\"Acelera workshop\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Cinco edições -->\n  <div class=\"content-grid two-col\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Desafios Reais, Resultados Reais</h3>\n      <p>Um dos elementos mais valorizados em todas as edições foi a aplicação dos aprendizados a desafios reais e atuais da Edenred. Os participantes são organizados em <strong>squads multifuncionais</strong>, recebem desafios reais de negócio selecionados pela própria liderança da empresa e trabalham ao longo dos módulos para construir propostas concretas de solução.</p>\n      <p>A metodologia do <strong>Duplo Diamante</strong> serve como estrutura de pensamento: primeiro o grupo mergulha fundo no problema, depois desenvolve e prototipa soluções. No pitch final, essas propostas são apresentadas para os executivos da Edenred. Nas primeiras edições, alguns desses projetos foram de fato implementados.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Cinco Edições, Uma Evolução</h3>\n      <p>O formato evoluiu ao longo das edições. O Acelera 4, realizado em 2025, ganhou uma <strong>plataforma digital exclusiva</strong> com todos os materiais do programa, os kits de aprendizagem, os registros fotográficos das sessões e as leituras complementares — tudo organizado em um site customizado especialmente para a jornada.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">Uma convicção central</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Há coisas que a tecnologia ainda não substitui — e construir confiança entre pessoas é uma delas.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== DREAM TEAM BOOTCAMP ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Dream Team Bootcamp · 2024–2025</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Cultura como<br>projeto coletivo</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid image-text\">\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia01_Reduzida__438.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>Enquanto o Acelera trabalha com o horizonte do desenvolvimento individual, o Dream Team Bootcamp mira um desafio diferente: como fazer com que uma empresa que cresceu absorvendo empresas e culturas diferentes encontre uma <strong>identidade compartilhada</strong>?</p>\n      <p>A Edenred possui um guia de cultura global chamado <strong>Dream Team</strong>, que define os valores e comportamentos que devem orientar a atuação de todas as lideranças em todos os países onde a empresa opera. No Brasil, com a diversidade de unidades de negócio convivendo sob o mesmo teto, tornar essa cultura viva exigiu um trabalho cuidadoso de tradução e cocriação.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Equilíbrio na Mudança</h4>\n            <p>Reconhecer a realidade vivida pelos líderes antes de pedir comprometimento com algo novo.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Inovação &amp; Mindset Explorador</h4>\n            <p>Valorizar a curiosidade e a disposição para experimentar como pilares da cultura Edenred.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Diversidade &amp; Inclusão</h4>\n            <p>Construir uma cultura onde a diversidade da operação se torna ativo estratégico, não fricção.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Relacionamentos Saudáveis entre Times</h4>\n            <p>Ferramentas concretas para aplicar com as equipes e criar uma cultura de confiança duradoura.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- VIDEO DESTAQUE -->\n  <div class=\"video-feature\">\n    <div class=\"video-feature-label\">O Programa em Movimento</div>\n    <video controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Alta__40.jpg?v=1779373656\">\n      <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/27ec1dfcdac24b2e8ffa5c1b63c0e651.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    </source></video>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Escala e impacto -->\n  <div class=\"content-grid two-col\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Um Retiro para Transformar a Cúpula</h3>\n      <p>O ponto de partida foi um <strong>retiro de dois dias com 120 top líderes</strong>, uma experiência intensiva que reuniu o CEO da operação brasileira e diretores seniores vindos da França para uma imersão em torno dos valores e comportamentos Dream Team no contexto brasileiro. Seis facilitadores da Hyper Island trabalharam simultaneamente em grupos de 40 pessoas, garantindo que a escala não sacrificasse a profundidade.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Expandindo para 400 Líderes</h3>\n      <p>O sucesso do retiro levou a Edenred a uma decisão ambiciosa: expandir o processo para <strong>400 líderes</strong>, cobrindo todos os níveis de liderança das Business Units do Brasil. Foram quatro encontros presenciais realizados em duas etapas — dois em São Paulo e dois no Rio Grande do Sul — para que o trabalho chegasse às diferentes regiões e realidades da operação.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">Resultado</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Uma cultura que não é imposta de cima, mas co-criada de dentro.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Galeria Dream Team -->\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery gallery-asym-right\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia01_Reduzida__281.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Reduzida__106.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-tall\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Alta__40.jpg?v=1779373656\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-4\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_33_51.png?v=1779373649\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Reduzida__12.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Reduzida__278.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/ChatGPT_Image_21_de_mai._de_2026_10_30_40.png?v=1779373649\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Galeria linha extra -->\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia01_Reduzida__301.jpg?v=1779373647\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia01_Reduzida__324.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/BootCamp2025_Dia02_Reduzida__278.jpg?v=1779373646\" alt=\"Dream Team Bootcamp\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== DARK BAND — O QUE A PARCERIA CONSTRÓI ==================== -->\n<div class=\"dark-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"dark-band-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"dark-band-label\">O que une os dois programas</div>\n      <div class=\"dark-band-title\">Duas frentes.<br>Uma mesma<br>convicção.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dark-band-text\">\n      <p style=\"color: rgba(245,244,240,0.65); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">O Acelera olha para quem vai liderar amanhã. O Dream Team Bootcamp trabalha com quem lidera hoje. Juntos, eles cobrem o espectro completo da jornada de uma organização que leva cultura e desenvolvimento a sério.</p>\n      <p style=\"color: rgba(245,244,240,0.65); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;\">O que atravessa os dois é a mesma filosofia: escutar antes de propor, co-criar antes de entregar, e medir o sucesso pelo que muda no comportamento das pessoas.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CLOSING ==================== -->\n<section class=\"closing-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"closing-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"closing-client-logo\">\n        <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/Edenred_Logo_%28depuis_2017%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=original\" alt=\"Edenred\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"closing-label\">O que essa parceria revela</div>\n      <h2 class=\"closing-title\">Uma organização<br>inteira que<br>confia no processo</h2>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\">\n        Somando todas as iniciativas, a Hyper Island impactou mais de 695 pessoas na Edenred ao longo de cinco anos — entre participantes do Acelera, líderes do Dream Team Bootcamp e grupos do ciclo expandido. Mas o número, por si só, conta apenas parte da história.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        Cultura se constrói em camadas, ao longo do tempo, com consistência e com a disposição de revisitar os mesmos temas sob ângulos diferentes à medida que a empresa muda. A Edenred encontrou na Hyper Island um parceiro capaz de acompanhar essa jornada.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cta-block\">\n      <div class=\"cta-block-title\">Quer construir uma parceria assim?</div>\n      <p>Cada organização tem desafios únicos. Nossa abordagem começa pela escuta — sempre.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/contato\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Fale Conosco</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== SCROLL ANIMATION ==================== -->\n<script>\n(function() {\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n      if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n        entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n      }\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -60px 0px' });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n})();\n</script>\n\n\n</body>",
